    "notes": "NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10, sm_121), driver 580.173.02, CUDA 13.0, aarch64 Ubuntu 24.04, 121 GiB unified memory. SGLang-Diffusion source build 0.0.0.dev60+g791c7850d (upstream main @791c7850d, which contains the Qwen-Image-2.1 PR #39983 merged 2026-09-20; the PyPI sglang[diffusion] 0.5.20 does not have this model at all), sglang-kernel 0.4.7, torch 2.13.0+cu130, diffusers 0.37.0.dev0, transformers 5.12.1. Configuration: online FP8 on the transformer only (--component-quantizations.transformer fp8); the Qwen3-VL text encoder stays bf16. Attention backend is Torch SDPA, which is what this build falls back to on SM12.x whatever is selected. Server process start to /health 200 was 61 s, which the result records as load_s null because the harness attached to a server it did not start. Ambient temperature unknown."
